 c("How did Mr Farnon's attitude differ from Herriot's in handling the case?", "Mr Farnon was more direct and impatient, while Herriot was gentle and diplomatic. Herriot handled the owner's feelings with care and followed a gradual treatment. Their different approaches show two ways of dealing with people, one blunt, one tactful, both aiming at the pet's good."),
